close_comment = "The daemon now embeds the compatibility matrix from docs/agent/COMPATIBILITY.md, and its README links to the same document. Dedicated regression tests cover the embedded document, the current compatibility row and release validation, so the document move no longer leaves this include pointing at a missing file."
